      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Eh? No, mira, estoy realizando labores\nde mantenimiento.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAunque ahora mismo me pillas tomándome\nun descanso.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres utilizar este Holotransportador?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00510075006900650072006500730020007500740069006C0069007A006100720020006500730074006500200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F0072003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pues va a ser que no! Me estoy encargando\nde su reparación.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAunque de momento lo único reparador es\nel descanso que me estoy tomando.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, ya que estamos, ¿por qué no echamos\nun combate Pokémon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00790065002C002000790061002000710075006500200065007300740061006D006F0073002C002000BF0070006F007200200071007500E90020006E006F00200065006300680061006D006F0073000A0075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con un buen combate mataré el gusanillo y podré\nrematar la faena en un pispás.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si quieres combatir, házmelo saber.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020007100750069006500720065007300200063006F006D00620061007400690072002C0020006800E1007A006D0065006C006F002000730061006200650072002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si me haces el favorcillo de combatir, me pondré\nmanos a la obra para rematar la faena enseguida.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Para obra maestra, mi victoria!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100500061007200610020006F0062007200610020006D006100650073007400720061002C0020006D006900200076006900630074006F00720069006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Paso, gracias",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000610073006F002C002000670072006100630069006100730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿No te hace? Pues nada, creo que me tomaré\nmi descanso con toda la pachorra del mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así me gusta! ¡Venga, al Tajo... Aéreo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007300ED0020006D00650020006700750073007400610021002000A100560065006E00670061002C00200061006C002000540061006A006F002E002E002E0020004100E900720065006F002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pfff, a ver quién es el guapo que arregla un\nHolotransportador en plena zona de combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cómo te has currado este combate! Bueeeno,\ndoy entonces este descanso por concluido.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Finiquitaré la reparación en un visto y no visto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100460069006E006900710075006900740061007200E90020006C006100200072006500700061007200610063006900F3006E00200065006E00200075006E00200076006900730074006F002000790020006E006F00200076006900730074006F002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Listos! ¡Ya se puede utilizar el Holotransportador\nde nuevo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006900730074006F00730021002000A1005900610020007300650020007000750065006400650020007500740069006C0069007A0061007200200065006C00200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F0072000A006400650020006E007500650076006F002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A propósito, todos los Pokémon con los que\nhe combatido contra ti los capturé en los tejados.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fue mientras estaba trabajando, y me distraje\ntanto en ello que, cuando me quise dar cuenta,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nya era hora del descanso... ¡Pero no se lo digas<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na mi jefe, eh!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 167
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En fin, que te recomiendo inspeccionar bien\nlos tejados, porque allí hay Pokémon de todo tipo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Viste como al final despaché la tarea en un visto\ny no visto? ¡Ja, bueno soy yo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En los tejados encuentras Pokémon de todo tipo.\nPrueba a buscar y verás.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
